+# FAA Flight77 packet: source-version differences and a released audio lead
+
+**All 77 previously outstanding page images are now inspected.** Together with the preceding pass, this covers the complete 72-page FAA Issues and Questions package (**F04**, NAID7596179) and 11-page Final FAA Testimony package (**F05**, NAID7601963). Their original PDF bytes are unchanged. This completes that reading dependency; it does **not** recover the corrected May 2003QFR/receipt or a signed administrative disposition.
+
+The comparison found printed differences in turn instructions, one acknowledgment’s seconds, radar-graphic hour labels, aircraft-type descriptions and how uncertainty was relayed. Each value remains tied to its own source. We also acquired and decoded an official NARA **Tyson-position MP3** relevant to the C-130 report. Its speech, historical clock and custody have not yet been verified.
+
+## Source and method boundaries
+
